<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59922" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρητ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Cretan</u>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ch.</u>
			616
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ra.</u>
			849
		</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ</span> K. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.53
				</span></i>
			, etc. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>in Cretan fashion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1165
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρητικόν</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>), τό,
				<i>short garment</i>, used at sacred rites, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				730
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				311
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρητικός</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῦς</span>), ὁ, a
			metrical foot [_ ^ _], 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίμακρος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				3.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				50.16
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγειρε . . , Μοῦσα</span>,
			K. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					222
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ</span> K. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				13.1
			</span></i>; K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυθμός, ῥυθμοί</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.4.16
			</span></i>.</div>
